description:
Below is a summary please refer to the Job pack for detailed information 

Thetford Town Council is seeking to appoint a single consultant practice to undertake the roles of:
•	Lead Designer;
•	Architect;
•	Conservation Architect;
•	Principal Designer (CDM Regulations);
•	Principal Designer (Building Safety Act).
The successful consultant shall lead and coordinate the design for the Development Phase and prepare the project design for submission of the NLHF Delivery Phase Application. Th
